; CLI integration tests live in tests/cli/*.t under the cram stanza
; declared in tests/cli/dune. dune exposes mathc to the cram shell
; via (deps %{bin:mathc}) thanks to (public_name mathc) in bin/dune.
; Each .t does `cd "$DUNE_SOURCEROOT"` first so mathc sees project-
; relative paths and echoes them back, keeping the .t files
; portable across machines without scrubbing.
;
; See OCAML_BEST_PRACTICES §11.20 for the cram-sandbox mechanics
; and the rationale for this layout.
